---
args: {"labelDescription": "string", "events": "Evidence[]", "rules": "string[]"}
returns: "ObservableLabel"
---
Write inclusion and exclusion criteria using the actual available evidence. Separate examples from governing rules, include borderline ambiguity and specify who adjudicates disagreement. Keep label version identity with any supplied observed annotations; a changed definition invalidates affected annotations rather than silently reusing them. Do not manufacture labeled examples or independent annotator outcomes.
